                <h3 class="entry-title"><a href="/research/xai/">Explainability for vision-language OCR</a></h3>
                <p class="entry-context">Undergraduate researcher · Virginia Tech</p>
                <p>
                    Instead of scoring a document model’s final answer, I am tracing how its reading of a page
                    changes from preprocessing through the vision tower and into the language model, and where
                    it starts to diverge from the ground truth. Heatmap attribution and the mechanistic
                    interpretability literature, applied to OCR.
